    "last_close": {
      "note": "Basis used when the live basis (FRESH intraday quotes only) observes fewer than min_observed_features: close-to-close changes of official daily closes (data_classes) that are the latest expected publication (close_status CURRENT), or older closes at most max_age_days old while their market is closed, plus proxy changes where proxy_features allows them (proxy symbol -> accepted change bases, at most max_age_days old). Proxies only ever fill change_pct (direction), never a level threshold such as the VIX level. Live-only features (the crypto rolling 24h change) are excluded from this basis and listed as such. Only live features count toward the live basis: a FRESH intraday quote, a curve of two of them, or a correlation whose legs both have FRESH quotes; the daily credit spread never does. Correlations are live-only and never enter this basis. This basis is for display (dashboard, /api/regime and briefs, always with its basis label); decision scoring keeps the live basis.",
      "data_classes": [
        "DAILY_CLOSE",
        "DERIVED_DAILY"
      ],
      "max_age_days": 7,
